    <p>Its almost midnight na po, and your birthday is about to become yesterday, but I wanted to catch these last few minutes with you before it does. I hope today gave you a reason to smile more than once. I hope somewhere in the middle of all of it, you felt how loved you are, popo.</p>

    <p>Another year of you. Another year I get to know you a little better, laugh with you a little more, love you a little deeper &mdash; and for sure I won't take that for granted, popo. I feel lucky in a way, na just knowing you, just being close to your life. And for sure, I always say this pero I do always pray for you and us, na sobrang blessed and grateful ko na I have you.</p>

    <p>So before the clock turns and today becomes a memory, I wanted to pray this before the day goes na: I'm so glad you're here. I'm so happy na you're mine to love, and I just want you to know na I'm so delighted na you were born, aly. Thank u kay tita na pinanganak ka niya, and thank u kay Lord on giving u life &mdash; my heart is so happy its you.</p>

    <p>Happiest birthday to the girl who makes everything better when she's on it. I love you always, aly.</p>

